        Improving operations for a childcare school
      </h2>
      <div class="text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted space-y-4">
        <p>
          Suppose teachers spend hours recording attendance, meals, naps, and
          parent updates across paper forms and disconnected tools. I would
          first observe the daily workflow and speak with teachers and
          administrators to find where time is actually being lost.
        </p>
        <p>
          I could then build a focused pilot: a tablet-friendly activity log,
          teacher-approved AI summaries for parents, and secure access for each
          family. After testing it at one location, I would use staff feedback
          and time-saved measurements to improve the product before a wider
          rollout.
        </p>
        <p class="text-faint">
          This is an illustration of my approach, not a completed client
          engagement.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

